# Library Functions, Scholarly Communication, and the Foundation of the Digital Library: Laying Claim to the Control Zone.

**Authors:** Atkinson, Ross

## Abstract
Discussion of academic libraries and online systems focuses on core library services and a digital library which could serve as an alternative publishing mechanism for specialized scholarly communication. Highlights include adding value to sources of information; conflicts, including those with commercial publishers; and standardization and coordination. (LRW)

